cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use any Trinity ternary neural network discoveries, please cite our defensive publication."
title: "Ternary Neural Networks: Theory to Training Farm"
abstract: "This bundle presents Trinity's comprehensive research on ternary neural networks, spanning theoretical foundations (T-JEPA, cosine scheduling with phi-warmup), implementation (HSLM 1.95M parameter model with PPL=125), training infrastructure (gradient accumulation, checkpoint compression, wave-based multi-account training), and evaluation (Cognitive Probes v7 with Min-K%++, Full-ECE calibration, temperature scaling v5, ROC/AUC analysis, contamination detection). All innovations published as defensive prior art with Zenodo DOIs."
